cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the relevant source publications for scientific methods and datasets. Cite this repository for its original documentation and curation. A repository URL will be added after publication."
type: software
title: "Experitome: Protocols, Analysis and Data"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
authors:
  - family-names: "He"
    given-names: "Shuaihan"
    affiliation: "Bioscience and Biomedical Engineering Thrust; Brain and Intelligence Research Institute; The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (Guangzhou)"
abstract: "An open-source project organizing practical research experience, experimental protocols, data resources, and analysis workflows into a traceable, reusable knowledge library. Current draft methods focus on C. elegans proteomics and TurboID. Data and analysis collections, exchange tools, and AI-assisted discovery are planned."
keywords:
  - experimental protocols
  - research resources
  - proteomics
  - reproducible analysis
  - data curation
